<title>UK: Three of today's four December Brent dates clocked.</title>
<headline>Three of today's four December Brent dates clocked.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Of the four Brent dates turning wet on Friday three were five o'clocked and one was kept, traders said.</p>
<p>Statoil kept a December 2-4 cargo but was clocked on a Dec 1-3 stem while J.P. Morgan and Phibro were both clocked on Dec 1-3 cargoes.</p>
</text>
